-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Respuesta de Frecuencia (-3 dB):<\/b> 95 Hz &#8211; 16,000 Hz.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rango de Frecuencia (-10 dB):<\/b> 83 Hz &#8211; 19,000 Hz.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sensibilidad (SPL \/ 1W @ 1m):<\/b> 87 dB.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">M\u00e1ximo SPL:<\/b> 100 dB (Pico de 106 dB).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Impedancia Nominal:<\/b> 16 Ohms (permite conectar m\u00faltiples parlantes en paralelo sin transformador).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Transformador Integrado (70V\/100V):<\/b> * Tomas de 70V: 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 W.<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8,7,1\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,7,1,0,0\">Tomas de 100V: 2, 4, 8, 16 W.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,8,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,8,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Certificaci\u00f3n de Resistencia:<\/b> <b data-path-to-node=\"8,8,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">IP55<\/b> (protecci\u00f3n contra chorros de agua y polvo).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,9,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,9,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color:<\/b> Negro (RAL 9005).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"128250000","regular_price":"128250000","sale_price":"128250000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"ARS","currency_symbol":"$","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"$","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#036;<\/span>1.282.500,00<\/span>","a